parse and validate treerig.toml

Usage:
  treerig config validate [flags]

Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -h, --help            help for validate

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto or plain (one line per
                        change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
